 == سجل التغييرات ==
 
+= 2.33.0 =
+* M271 for the app (owner, 2026-11-25: «عضوية شركاء النجاح بتكون لمدة 360 يوم»): a third membership kind, given and taken back from the app dashboard only (`admin_grant` actions `partner` / `partner_revoke`; nothing is sold and no client op can set it). Two new columns, `partner_at` and `partner_days` (360). It ends by itself after its 360 days. A paid membership the account had, or buys meanwhile, keeps counting underneath (`paid_*`), and the live columns always hold whichever of the two ends later, so no gate, list or reminder changed.
+* The contact shapes (`account`, `admin_grant`, `member_status`, `admin_accounts`…) gain `partner`, `partner_since`, `partner_end`, `partner_left`; `admin_stats.totals` gains `members_partner`. New event kinds `partner`, `partner_revoked`.
+* While it runs, `activate` / `extend` / `revoke` from the app dashboard and the hub page's convert / renew buttons are refused. One given membership at a time: it and the honorary one refuse each other (code `partner` / `honorary`).
+
 = 2.32.0 =
 * Price-card member check by MOBILE NUMBER (owner, 2026-11-24: «رقم جوالك المسجّل في التطبيق… مفيش ايميل اصلا»): `POST /vibes-ai/v1/member-check` takes `phone` (optional `country`, default `sa`; optional `lang` = `en` for English texts). The number is normalised exactly like registration and `phone_login` (05…, 5…, 9665…, +9665…, 009665…, Arabic-Indic digits, spaces and dashes; another country in full international form) and the 4-digit code goes to that number on WhatsApp through the app server (`whatsapp.send`, kind `code`). No mail fallback: a send that fails answers 503 `send_failed`. A member with a phone and no e-mail works end to end.
 * The code of this road lives in its own transient (10 minutes, burnt after 5 wrong tries), so it never replaces an account's sign-up / sign-in code. `verify` → `active` answers `name`, the masked `phone` (last three digits), `member_end`, `member_left` (an open-ended membership: `member_end` '' and `member_left` null) — never the full number or an e-mail.
